#: templates/base/hub_gone.html:11 templates/base/hub_gone.html:16
msgid "This demo has ended"
msgstr "La demo ha terminado"

#: templates/base/hub_gone.html:11 templates/base/hub_gone.html:20
msgid "This business is no longer available"
msgstr "Este negocio ya no está disponible"

#: templates/base/hub_gone.html:17
msgid ""
"Everything typed in it is gone. You can start another one whenever you like."
msgstr ""
"Todo lo que escribiste en ella se ha borrado. Puedes empezar otra cuando "
"quieras."

#: templates/base/hub_gone.html:18
msgid "Create another demo"
msgstr "Crear otra demo"

#: templates/base/hub_gone.html:21
msgid ""
"Its owner closed it in ERPlora. If it is yours, you can bring it back from "
"your account."
msgstr ""
"Su propietario lo cerró en ERPlora. Si es tuyo, puedes recuperarlo desde tu "
"cuenta."

#: templates/base/hub_gone.html:22 templates/base/hub_suspended.html:17
msgid "Go to ERPlora"
msgstr "Ir a ERPlora"

#: templates/base/hub_preparing.html:12 templates/base/hub_preparing.html:16
msgid "Your business is being prepared"
msgstr "Estamos preparando tu negocio"

#: templates/base/hub_preparing.html:17
msgid "It takes a few seconds. This page refreshes by itself."
msgstr "Tarda unos segundos. Esta página se actualiza sola."

#: templates/base/hub_suspended.html:11 templates/base/hub_suspended.html:15
msgid "This business is suspended"
msgstr "Este negocio está suspendido"

#: templates/base/hub_suspended.html:16
msgid ""
"An invoice of its plan is unpaid. Its data is safe: as soon as whoever pays "
"it settles the invoice in ERPlora, it works again."
msgstr ""
"Hay una factura de su plan sin pagar. Sus datos están a salvo: en cuanto "
"quien lo paga abone la factura en ERPlora, vuelve a funcionar."

